  "extract": "The Wedding Palace or Palace of Rituals is a building in Tbilisi designed by architects Victor Djorbenadze and Vazha Orbeladze. It was built in 1984 as a wedding venue.",
  "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Wedding Palace</b> or <b>Palace of Rituals</b> is a building in Tbilisi designed by architects Victor Djorbenadze and Vazha Orbeladze. It was built in 1984 as a wedding venue.</p>"
